% expect-output: abc
% expect-output: (\\(x\\))
% Scenario: a token ended by a delimiter leaves the delimiter unread.
% Expect: prints "abc" (the executable name) then "(\(x\))" — the "("
% begins the remainder.
(abc(x)) token pop == ==
